{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":14677,\"date\":\"2026-05-07T19:33:48+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-07T13:37:25+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-17-primo-mondo-q1-2026-counterpoint\",\"title\":\"iPhone 17 primo al mondo nel Q1 2026, secondo Counterpoint\",\"excerpt\":\"Nel primo trimestre 2026, iPhone 17 è lo smartphone più venduto a livello globale: 6% delle unità, con la serie che domina le prime tre posizioni secondo Counterpoint.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iPhone-17-Colors-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-17-Colors\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":7,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14673,\"date\":\"2026-05-07T17:33:28+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-07T13:37:08+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-18-pro-display-ltpo-plus-samsung-lg\",\"title\":\"iPhone 18 Pro: upgrade display LTPO+ da Samsung e LG\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo The Elec, Apple starebbe finalizzando le approvazioni dei pannelli OLED per iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max. LTPO+ dovrebbe arrivare da Samsung Display e LG Display.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iPhone-18-Pro-with-a-smaller-centered-Dynamic-Island-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-18-Pro-with-a-smaller-centered-Dynamic-Island\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14576,\"date\":\"2026-05-05T12:50:12+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-05T10:50:12+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-valuta-intel-e-samsung-come-fornitori-alternativi-di-chip-usa\",\"title\":\"Apple valuta Intel e Samsung come fornitori alternativi di chip USA\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, Apple avrebbe avviato colloqui esplorativi con Intel e Samsung per produrre i principali processori negli Stati Uniti, come possibile alternativa a TSMC.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/tsmc_semiconductor_chip_inspection_678x452-768x509.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"tsmc_semiconductor_chip_inspection_678x452\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14545,\"date\":\"2026-05-03T20:51:42+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-03T18:51:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-air-2-unico-top-ultra-sottile\",\"title\":\"iPhone Air 2 potrebbe restare l’unico top ultra-sottile\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker su Weibo, le vendite deboli di iPhone Air avrebbero spinto rivali e produttori a rinunciare a piani per telefoni ultra-sottili. iPhone Air 2 sarebbe quindi in pole come unica proposta di fascia alta.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/iphone-17-air-768x431.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-17-air\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14489,\"date\":\"2026-04-28T19:26:47+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-28T17:26:47+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-20th-anniversary-display-liquid-glass-per-far-sparire-le-cornici\",\"title\":\"iPhone 20th Anniversary: display “Liquid Glass” per far sparire le cornici\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un leaker, l’iPhone per il 20° anniversario potrebbe usare una nuova tecnologia di schermo curva per ridurre al minimo la visibilità delle cornici.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Mostly-Screen-iPhone-Purple-Feature-2027-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Mostly-Screen-iPhone-Purple-Feature-2027\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":6,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14399,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:11:43+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07:11:43+00:00\",\"slug\":\"dummy-iphone-18-pro-max-plateau-fotocamera-piu-spesso\",\"title\":\"Dummy iPhone 18 Pro Max: possibile plateau fotocamera più spesso\",\"excerpt\":\"Nuove immagini di dummy per iPhone 18 Pro e Pro Max suggeriscono un plateau della fotocamera più spesso e lenti che sporgono di più rispetto a iPhone 17 Pro Max.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iphone-18-pro-17-pro-dummy-comparison402x-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone-18-pro-17-pro-dummy-comparison402x\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14334,\"date\":\"2026-04-18T13:32:53+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-18T11:32:53+00:00\",\"slug\":\"fedelta-iphone-964-android-piu-propensi-a-cambiare\",\"title\":\"Fedeltà iPhone al 96,4%: utenti Android più propensi a cambiare\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo un sondaggio SellCell, il 96,4% degli utenti iPhone intende restare su iPhone al prossimo upgrade, mentre tra gli utenti Android la quota di chi valuta il cambio sale al 13,6%.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/smartphone-brand-loyalty-survey-2026-768x497.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"smartphone-brand-loyalty-survey-2026\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14324,\"date\":\"2026-04-18T13:32:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-18T11:32:22+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-oled-arrivo-ipad-mini-macbook-pro\",\"title\":\"Apple: OLED in arrivo per iPad mini e MacBook Pro\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo ETNews, Apple introdurrà display OLED su iPad mini e MacBook Pro nel corso di quest’anno. Samsung fornirebbe i pannelli.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/ipad-mini-7-feature-red-and-blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ipad-mini-7-feature-red-and-blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14282,\"date\":\"2026-04-15T21:20:24+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-15T19:20:24+00:00\",\"slug\":\"oled-ipad-mini-data-rilascio-prezzo-cosa-aspettarsi\",\"title\":\"OLED iPad mini: data di rilascio, prezzo e cosa aspettarsi\",\"excerpt\":\"Rumor e indiscrezioni indicano che Apple potrebbe aggiornare l’iPad mini 8 con chip A19 Pro e display OLED, oltre a miglioramenti di resistenza all’acqua e un possibile aumento di prezzo.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPad\",\"categorySlug\":\"ipad\",\"categoryId\":10,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/ipad-mini-7-feature-red-and-blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"ipad-mini-7-feature-red-and-blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13987,\"date\":\"2026-03-24T13:57:20+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-24T12:57:20+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-riorienta-catena-fornitura-display-oled\",\"title\":\"Apple Riorienta la Catena di Fornitura dei Display per una Nuova Ondata di Dispositivi OLED\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta riducendo la sua dipendenza dai produttori cinesi in vista del lancio di nuovi prodotti con pannelli OLED, secondo quanto riportato da DigiTimes.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Apple-MacBook-Pro-M4-hero-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple MacBook Pro M hero\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13972,\"date\":\"2026-03-21T18:19:42+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-21T17:20:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"migliori-offerte-apple-settimana-airpods-pro-3\",\"title\":\"Le Migliori Offerte Apple della Settimana: AirPods Pro 3 a 208,00 €, Prezzo Più Basso su Amazon\",\"excerpt\":\"Questa settimana, le offerte Apple includono il ritorno del prezzo più basso di sempre per gli AirPods Pro 3, Apple Watch Series 11 e sconti sui nuovi prodotti Apple.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Best-Apple-Deals-Feature-Shelf-0004-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Best Apple Deals Feature Shelf\",\"authorName\":\"A